{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/0wf2jq","slideIndex":0,"text":"主题提案，故事与视觉均为原创设计建议，尚未确定为最终游戏设定。\n图片为内置 image_gen 生成的概念图，不是游戏截图，也不是可直接导入的模型或材质。\n生成提示词：Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: game art direction presentation, cinematic environment concept. Landscape 16:9 painterly 3D game environment concept for a drowned lighthouse royal city. Explore an air-filled abandoned fortress hall above floodwater, vaulted salt-eroded stone, oxidized green copper pipes, rusty wrought iron platforms, coral and barnacles along the lower walls, shallow still puddles, harbor ropes and navigation relics. Tall windows show a cold dark sea and a distant lighthouse beam. A small armored drowned sailor sentinel for scale. Elevated dry maintenance decks and ramps surround a lighthouse machinery arena, amber lanterns mark the usable route. Dark ocean navy #17333E, patinated copper #4D887C, salted stone #B8B3A4, rust #9B5136, lantern amber #E7B55A. Moody but physically readable, stylized physically based material study, no need for complex fluid effects, no text, labels, logos, watermark or HUD.\n\n素材搜集要求：优先可拼接建筑模块，检查底部枢轴、统一厘米尺度、UV、简单碰撞与可步行面。角色需要骨骼、基础待机/移动/受击动画，武器需要独立可拆部件。PBR贴图至少包括Base Color、Normal、Roughness、AO，金属件另需Metallic，能源或灯具另需Emissive遮罩。建议首版采用2K可平铺材质及独立贴花。按项目使用范围核对授权和来源，保持同一写实或风格化程度。关键词用于检索素材类型，不指向已验证的具体商品。\n\nP1 氛围扩展：海雾、扫光、窗外海面。首版用静态积水，主路线保持干燥。"}
