{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/xl00a8","slideIndex":1,"text":"主题提案，故事与视觉均为原创设计建议，尚未确定为最终游戏设定。\n图片为内置 image_gen 生成的概念图，不是游戏截图，也不是可直接导入的模型或材质。\n生成提示词：Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: material and modeling reference board for game art. Cohesive wide 16:9 studio tabletop composition on dark ocean navy background showing assets for a drowned lighthouse city: salt-eroded stone arch module behind, corroded copper pipe elbow and a lighthouse lens assembly, rusty grated catwalk section, nautical rope and winch, a weathered amber lantern, a barnacle-encrusted armored sailor sentinel with a nautical harpoon-shaped carbine, a navigation compass relic. Natural sample chunks of copper patina, rusty iron, salt-stained stone and barnacles in the foreground. Spacious legible original prop designs, painterly game concept render, cold soft light with warm lantern amber, rough physically based surfaces, no text, labels, cards, UI, logos or watermark. Moodboard references, not final models.\n\n素材搜集要求：优先可拼接建筑模块，检查底部枢轴、统一厘米尺度、UV、简单碰撞与可步行面。角色需要骨骼、基础待机/移动/受击动画，武器需要独立可拆部件。PBR贴图至少包括Base Color、Normal、Roughness、AO，金属件另需Metallic，能源或灯具另需Emissive遮罩。建议首版采用2K可平铺材质及独立贴花。按项目使用范围核对授权和来源，保持同一写实或风格化程度。关键词用于检索素材类型，不指向已验证的具体商品。\n\nP1 氛围扩展：海雾、扫光、窗外海面。首版用静态积水，主路线保持干燥。\n配色：深海蓝 #17333E, 铜绿 #4D887C, 盐蚀石灰 #B8B3A4, 灯笼琥珀 #E7B55A\n核心材质：盐蚀石、铜绿、锈铁。冷色环境中，用暖灯标记可通行路线。"}